{"2626090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kill Ball", "steam_appid": 2626090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1996, and the popular game show Kill Ball is now in its third season. This high-stakes blood sport has gained more popularity than ever before! You can now enjoy all the fun of Killball in the comfort of your own home with your friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players find themselves in an Arena resembling the game PONG, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring the ball will grant the player <strong>one </strong>Explosive Bullet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, though, as players can only hold one bullet in their rifle at a time. Getting killed by the KillBall or Player results in you losing your bullet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so make your shots count </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>three Kills</strong> Wins the game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the Pong paddles and player at the same time, use the controller triggers to move the Pong paddle up and down, and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the analog sticks to control the player in the arena </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Steam Remote Play to play online with your friends. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game only supports Local multiplayer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Controller support  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move players freely across the arena play area. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >top-down with 360 degrees of aiming </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the Win/loss count at the end of each game.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a game that feels like rubbing your belly and patting your head simultaneously. </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's 1996, and the popular game show Kill Ball is now in its third season. This high-stakes blood sport has gained more popularity than ever before! You can now enjoy all the fun of Killball in the comfort of your own home with your friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players find themselves in an Arena resembling the game PONG, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring the ball will grant the player <strong>one </strong>Explosive Bullet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, though, as players can only hold one bullet in their rifle at a time. Getting killed by the KillBall or Player results in you losing your bullet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so make your shots count </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first player to get <strong>three Kills</strong> Wins the game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the Pong paddles and player at the same time, use the controller triggers to move the Pong paddle up and down, and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the analog sticks to control the player in the arena </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Steam Remote Play to play online with your friends. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game only supports Local multiplayer.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Controller support  </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move players freely across the arena play area. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >top-down with 360 degrees of aiming </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of the Win/loss count at the end of each game.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a game that feels like rubbing your belly and patting your head simultaneously. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Battle against your friends and loved ones in Kill Ball! Score a goal and get an explosive bullet to kill your opponent. The first player to reach three kills wins the game and all the glory.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626090/header.jpg?t=1739411131", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739411131", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2626090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739411131", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I3 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 900 series or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Unity Game able to run on a wide range of computers</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Zac Smith"], "publishers": ["Zac Smith"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 99, "fi